How to configure huawei routers to import BGP routes from another routing instance into the base router's unlabeled-IPv4 RIB using the policy named "INTERNAL_POLICY_1" and "BACKUP_POLICY"?
```json
{
  "commands": [
    "route-policy INTERNAL_POLICY_1 permit node 10",
    "if-match ip-prefix INTERNAL_PREFIXES",
    "apply cost +100",
    "route-policy BACKUP_POLICY permit node 20",
    "if-match ip-prefix BACKUP_PREFIXES",
    "bgp 100",
    "import-route protocol bgp route-policy INTERNAL_POLICY_1",
    "import-route protocol bgp route-policy BACKUP_POLICY"
  ]
}
```
