Configure huawei routers to allow only BGP and SR-TE tunnel types for resolving unlabeled BGP routes.
```json
{
  "commands": [
    "route-policy BGP_SRTE permit node 10",
    "if-match protocol bgp",
    "apply tunnel-selector SRTE_ONLY",
    "tunnel-selector SRTE_ONLY permit node 10",
    "if-match tunnel-type sr-te",
    "quit"
  ]
}
```
